    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BEYOND THE PLASTIC WALL is an atmospheric narrative puzzler about hope, decay and the things we cannot fix. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418040/extras/10893d029db79c3618485dfb9a5b7596.poster.avif?t=1747032750\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418040/extras/10893d029db79c3618485dfb9a5b7596.webm?t=1747032750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418040/extras/10893d029db79c3618485dfb9a5b7596.mp4?t=1747032750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the shoes of a young scavenger, you'll set off on a journey across a strange continent that will take you over lonely archipelagos, ancient machine graveyards and barren wastelands - and eventually into the chaotic, bustling alleyways, seedy bars and towering skyscrapers of the last city at the end of the world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418040/extras/b8668b36af0bdacee08a4b3bac774577.poster.avif?t=1747032750\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418040/extras/b8668b36af0bdacee08a4b3bac774577.webm?t=1747032750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418040/extras/b8668b36af0bdacee08a4b3bac774577.mp4?t=1747032750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll repair, manipulate and fiddle with a varied range of mechanical and tactile puzzles to progress the story but also to unlock optional story elements. Every puzzle presents unique challenges but they all work on a shared logic. At first they will seem alien and opaque but as your understanding of these devices deepen, so will their complexity. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418040/extras/547053433a686d05909e5e365c7650d5.poster.avif?t=1747032750\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418040/extras/547053433a686d05909e5e365c7650d5.webm?t=1747032750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418040/extras/547053433a686d05909e5e365c7650d5.mp4?t=1747032750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich in details, BEYOND THE PLASTIC WALL utilises innovative graphical and visual rendering techniques to create a wholly unique look and experience.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BEYOND THE PLASTIC WALL is an atmospheric narrative puzzler about hope, decay and the things we cannot fix. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418040/extras/10893d029db79c3618485dfb9a5b7596.poster.avif?t=1747032750\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418040/extras/10893d029db79c3618485dfb9a5b7596.webm?t=1747032750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418040/extras/10893d029db79c3618485dfb9a5b7596.mp4?t=1747032750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the shoes of a young scavenger, you'll set off on a journey across a strange continent that will take you over lonely archipelagos, ancient machine graveyards and barren wastelands - and eventually into the chaotic, bustling alleyways, seedy bars and towering skyscrapers of the last city at the end of the world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418040/extras/b8668b36af0bdacee08a4b3bac774577.poster.avif?t=1747032750\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418040/extras/b8668b36af0bdacee08a4b3bac774577.webm?t=1747032750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418040/extras/b8668b36af0bdacee08a4b3bac774577.mp4?t=1747032750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll repair, manipulate and fiddle with a varied range of mechanical and tactile puzzles to progress the story but also to unlock optional story elements. Every puzzle presents unique challenges but they all work on a shared logic. At first they will seem alien and opaque but as your understanding of these devices deepen, so will their complexity. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418040/extras/547053433a686d05909e5e365c7650d5.poster.avif?t=1747032750\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418040/extras/547053433a686d05909e5e365c7650d5.webm?t=1747032750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418040/extras/547053433a686d05909e5e365c7650d5.mp4?t=1747032750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich in details, BEYOND THE PLASTIC WALL utilises innovative graphical and visual rendering techniques to create a wholly unique look and experience.</p>",
